  "title": "wimaxasncp: fix Coverity unsafe_xml_parse_config issue",
  "description": "Fix Coverity unsafe_xml_parse_config.\n\n```\nCID 1649289: (#1 of 1): unsafe_xml_parse_config (UNSAFE_XML_PARSE_CONFIG)\nunsafe_xml_parse_config: XML parse option should not have flag XML_PARSE_NOENT set, which is vulnerable to XML external entity attack.\n```\nwimaxasncp plugin uses a single dictionary.xml and dtd file.\n\nTherefore, `XML_PARSE_NOENT` is not needed in `xmlReadFile`.",
